Z||000025||MinnGreenGT||12-20-2001||01:25 PM||||Joe- too bad we all don't live closer together. It'd be a blast to have a "Fast & Furious Fiero party!"<P><BR>Fieromaster: Yup- the info is in the thread, toward the bottom (<A HREF="http://www.moslerengineering.com" TARGET=_blank>mosler engineering</A>)  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/012456.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/012456.html</A> <P>Edit: Oh yeah, about the engine type being backwards. Oh well, it'll just add to the "mystery" of the swap.  Or at least it'll leave the confused look on most people's faces longer!<p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 12-20-2001).]||||reg||1
